WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Strong growth in new cases every day.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
This is the point where we have to do something.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
It is a lockdown situation.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
It is a fight against Covid-19.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The number of infections worries the population.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
There is no reason for fear,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
but there is reason for all of us to be careful.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
2020 brought us a scenario never seen before.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Together, but apart, we got through difficult times,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
and the only certainty was the resilience in each of us.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Today we are even stronger

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
and we now have a very special ally:

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
our new website.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
At era.pt our clients find a unique experience,

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
on both desktop and mobile.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Simpler, more intuitive navigation.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
A new, fully personalised look,

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
based on your latest searches or your location.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000
A fast, smart search

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
that, for the first time in Portugal,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
lets you search several locations at once.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.000
We offer tools that help our clients

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.000
make their dreams come true,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
so that our work is much more on target.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Now they can easily share the properties they searched,

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.000
leave personal notes on each one,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
save favourites or exclude the ones they don't like.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.000
It has never been so simple to find out what your home is worth,

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.000
or to create your own listing.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
An open door to bringing us one more client.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.000
We are ready to take on more challenges

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.000
and do new business, always as a network.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.000
It's time to turn the page

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.000
and build the future. ERA.
